{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1465340-on-uratha-and-astrology","id":1465340,"title":"On Uratha and Astrology","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Werewolf: The Forsaken"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-10-25T16:24:43-07:00","id":1465340,"title":"On Uratha and Astrology","content":"One of my favorite books from Werewolf: the Apocalypse was &quot;Rage Across the Heavens&quot;, providing a unique cultural practice to give Garou society more depth, as well as a kit of cool new Gifts to use. So, how can something similar be achieved with Werewolf: the Forsaken, given 1) the hard limit of the Moon's orbit for Shadow exploration, and 2) the extremely hostile nature of the spirits found in space?<br /> <br /> My initial thought was to have Uratha astrology be backed by specialized spirit courts under the Firstborn, or perhaps under the conceptual spirits of star sign systems?.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/665-shkspr1048","name":"shkspr1048","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"630"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-25T16:43:21-07:00","id":1465342,"title":"","content":"I have no idea what Rage Across the Heavens was about but there's a variety of books that expand upon Uratha society and setting. Lore of the Forsaken is a big one for first edition, and even the Pack and Shunned by the Moon and the assorted Dark Eras do so for second.<br /> <br /> If it's just astrology you need, there are also Stellar Eclipse Auspice wolves, introduced in Signs of the Moon. You could associate them with the different stars or planets if you want giving them different advantages or Auspice powers depending on how you think these stellar objects should be represented. For an easy one there's the lodges, like the Temple of Apollo. Its totem is a spirit hiding in the blazing sea of the sun. While unable to breach Luna's barrier personally he can clearly influence werewolves through it, at least enough to get cult of them that have been around for centuries. It would be comparatively easy to have particularly noteworthy planetary angels or void spirits or even void leviathans (the last is given as an example lodge who maintain the power of void reivers without going insane).<br /> <br /> Just me, but I'd probably avoid the use of Firstborn for this unless they were ones that had left Earth long ago.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-25T18:10:47-07:00","id":1465346,"title":"","content":"Lodges of Ghost Wolves or Pure seem like the best fit; the former would be unaware or uncaring of the Warden Moon\u2019s vigil against the Void, and the latter would oppose it with glee.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>MtAw Homebrew:<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e#post1051456\" target=\"_blank\">Even more Legacies, updated to 2E</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1443819-new-2e-legacies-expanded\" target=\"_blank\">New 2E Legacies, expanded</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit","name":"21C Hermit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12619_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3489"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-25T21:04:39-07:00","id":1465350,"title":"","content":"While I could see potential Lodges dedicated to astrological phenomena, I'd like to develop a system potentially open to everyone; perhaps something Merit-based, that the Lodges could get a cost-break on, or more rarified goodies..","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/665-shkspr1048","name":"shkspr1048","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"630"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}